        "format": "html",
        "html": "<style type=\"text/css\">.lettersmith-defaults p,.lettersmith-defaults li{white-space:pre-wrap}.lettersmith-defaults hr{height:1px;border-width:0}.lettersmith-defaults li.unchecked::marker{content:\"\\2610\"}.lettersmith-defaults li.checked::marker{content:\"\\2612\"}</style><div class=\"lettersmith-defaults\"><!-- lettersmith-style-state:v2: -->\n\n<!-- lettersmith-message:v2 -->\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:28pt; font-weight:700; color:#f1eee8\">Dear Amani Hill,</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px\"><br></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px\">Hey Amani, it's been a while! I hope all is well with you and that life has been treating you kindly. I just wanted to take a moment to send you some encouragement and wish you the very best in whatever you've been up to.</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px\">I pray that God continues to guide you, bless you, and give you strength through whatever comes your way. Keep moving forward, stay encouraged, and never forget that with God, all things are possible.</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px\"><a href=\"ultralink:%E2%80%94%20Philippians%204%3A13\" style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:700; font-style:italic; color:#fffb82\">“I can do all this through him who gives me strength.”</span></a><span style=\"font-weight:700; color:#fffb82\"> </span><span style=\"font-weight:700\"><br></span></p></div>",
